cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SAMSON MLIP Visualizer
message: "If SAMSON MLIP Visualizer contributes to published work, please cite the repository release."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gutsev
    given-names: Lavrenty G.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9679-9093"
    affiliation: "Louisiana Tech University"
abstract: >-
  Runs machine-learned interatomic potentials (MACE, DeepMD-kit, UMA, AIMNet2) and
  semi-empirical/quantum backends (xTB, Psi4) on structures in SAMSON Connect through
  ASE: relaxations, transition-state searches with IRC confirmation, free-energy
  sampling, benchmarking, Δ-learning and active-learning fine-tuning, and a remote
  control bridge (CLI and MCP server). Includes worked examples and HPC job packages.
keywords:
  - machine-learned interatomic potentials
  - MACE
  - DeepMD
  - ASE
  - SAMSON
  - transition states
  - delta learning
